          "field": "summary",
          "value": "In this side-scrolling action game, you fight against your arch-enemy The Leader and his forces (Rhino, Absorbing Man, Abomination and Tyrannus).\n\nTake control of the Hulk/Dr. Banner through five levels of action: City and Construction Site, Tyrannus' Labyrinth, Leader's Fortress, Leader's Interior, and the Final Confrontation.",
