        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "The Incredible Hulk: Ultimate Destruction",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Incredible Hulk: Ultimate Destruction, released in 2005, is an action-adventure video game developed by Radical Entertainment and published by Vivendi Universal Games (VU Games). The game centres around the Marvel Comics superhero, the Hulk, and features an open world with destructible environments. The storyline depicts the Hulk being unconsciously guided by his human alter-ego, Bruce Banner, and his psychotherapist, Leonard Samson. They influence him to construct a device aimed at healing Banner's psyche and preventing the emergence of a darker personality. In addition to progressing through the main narrative, players can undertake side missions and acquire new abilities for the Hulk.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "The Incredible Hulk: Ultimate Destruction, lanzado en 2005, es un videojuego de acción y aventura desarrollado por Radical Entertainment y publicado por Vivendi Universal Games (VU Games). El juego gira en torno al superhéroe de Marvel Comics Hulk y cuenta con un mundo abierto con entornos destructibles. La historia muestra a Hulk guiado inconscientemente por su alter ego humano, Bruce Banner, y por su psicoterapeuta, Leonard Samson. Ambos lo inducen a construir un dispositivo destinado a sanar la psique de Banner e impedir la aparición de una personalidad más oscura. Además de avanzar en la trama principal, los jugadores pueden emprender misiones secundarias y adquirir nuevas habilidades para Hulk.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2005",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
